#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:1
msgid "战⽃体验-方案5细化"
msgstr "Battle Experience - Plan 5 Details"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:3
msgid "作者"
msgstr "Author"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:4
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;早起侠"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Early Riser Hero"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:7
msgid "1 - 认识"
msgstr "1 - Understanding"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:9
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;我对\"战⽃体验-方案5\"的理解是：AI + 战场上的临时调度。其中："
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;My understanding of \"Battle Experience - Plan 5\" is: AI + "
"real-time battlefield dispatch. Specifically:"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:10
msgid "AI部分，具体到每个⼩兵的⾏为，类似于微操。"
msgstr ""
"The AI part — specific to each individual unit's behavior, similar to "
"micro-management."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:11
msgid "战场上的临时调度，类似于宏观运营之类。"
msgstr "Real-time battlefield dispatch, similar to macro-management."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:13
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;之前的⽅案中，也有“AI + 战场上的临时调度”的意思。这次，在方案5中，提到“玩点类似Clash "
"Royale”和“选择出战的⻆⾊和位置”，这两让“战场上临时调度”的概念对我来说更清晰、形象了。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;方案5中有2个设计，我很喜欢：“AOE能⼒强”和 “⽬标优先级”。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;之前，当想要具体到可执⾏的下⼀步⼯作时，我的想法⽐较局限在现有的的模式⾥（横版战⽃ - "
"伤害+防御/躲避）。我也倾向于增加⼀些策略元素，弱化⼀些动作元素，但在这种模式下，没有想到好的⽅法，⼤概这种模式本⾝就⽐较倾向于动作，所以想要突出策略"
" 会有些怪怪的。 &emsp;&emsp;“AOE能⼒强”和“⽬标优先级”这两点，我觉得为策略的具体实现提供了⼀些⽅向。也和“AI + "
"战场上的临时调度”⽐较搭调。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Previous plans also had the concept of \"AI + real-time "
"battlefield dispatch.\" This time, in Plan 5, mentioning \"gameplay "
"similar to Clash Royale\" and \"selecting characters and positions for "
"battle\" made the concept of \"real-time battlefield dispatch\" clearer "
"and more vivid to me.   &emsp;&emsp;There are 2 designs in Plan 5 that I "
"really like: \"Strong AOE capabilities\" and \"Target Priority.\"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Previously, when trying to get to an executable next step, my"
" thinking was limited to the existing mode (side-scrolling combat - "
"damage + defense/dodge). I also tended to add strategic elements and "
"weaken action elements, but in this mode, I couldn't find a good "
"approach. Perhaps this mode inherently leans toward action, so trying to "
"emphasize strategy felt somewhat awkward. &emsp;&emsp;\"Strong AOE "
"capabilities\" and \"Target Priority\" — I think these two points provide"
" some direction for concrete strategy implementation. They also fit well "
"with \"AI + real-time battlefield dispatch.\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:18
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;方案5⽐较宏观，且有⼀定的发散。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;我倾向于有⼀个更具体的、下⼀步好执⾏的⽅案。（也许这个想法不对，不⼀定适合现状，可以有⼀些讨论或者磨合。我基于我⾃⼰现在的认识中，还是⽐较倾向于这种做法）"
"   因此就有了这里的想法。也还没具体到那个程度，不过想法有⼀定形状了，写下来，再讨论⼀下。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Plan 5 is quite macro-level and somewhat divergent.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;I prefer having a more concrete plan that's easy to execute "
"as a next step. (Perhaps this thinking isn't correct and may not suit the"
" current situation — there can be some discussion and refinement. Based "
"on my current understanding, I still lean toward this approach.)   Hence "
"these ideas. They're not yet fully concrete, but the ideas have taken "
"some shape, so I'm writing them down for further discussion."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:22
msgid "2 - 细化⽅案"
msgstr "2 - Detailed Plan"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:24
msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:26
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;横向的视⻆。双⽅对阵，有前排、后排感觉的那种战场。⽐如，⼸⽮只能打到最前⾯的⼈，所以后排的⼈就会受到保护；再⽐如，友⽅可以从友⽅⾝边⾃由的前后⾛动，⽽碰到敌⽅就⾛不过去了。（想法的来源：⼑塔传奇）"
"   玩家在战场的临时调度有2个：1.上场，2.控制AI的⽬标 - "
"可能是1个单位或1个范围。（“控制AI的⽬标”想法的来源：方案5的“⽬标优先级”，RTS游戏的微操）"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Side-scrolling perspective. Two sides face off in a "
"battlefield with a front-line and back-line feel. For example, arrows can"
" only hit the frontmost units, so back-line units are protected; friendly"
" units can freely walk past each other, but can't pass through enemy "
"units. (Source of inspiration: Dota Legend/DotA)   Players have 2 real-"
"time battlefield dispatch options: 1. Deploy units, 2. Control AI targets"
" — which can be a single unit or an area. (Source of the \"Control AI "
"targets\" idea: Plan 5's \"Target Priority\" and RTS game micro-"
"management.)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:29
msgid "**玩家有3种单位：⼸⼿、盾⼭、狂战⼠**"
msgstr "**Players have 3 types of units: Archer, Shield Mountain, Berserker**"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:30
msgid ""
"1.⼸⼿   &emsp;&emsp;⼸⼿⼀次射出3只箭。有⼀定的AOE能⼒。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;玩家在操作时，可以选择不同的射箭⽅向。因此得到偏直线的箭，或者⾼抛物线的箭。因此可以实现打到后排、AOE伤害等效果。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;⼸⼿的⾏为，只有左右移动和攻击。 <img "
"src=\"/img/design/gameplay/battle1.png\" alt=\"弓手示意1\" width=\"400px\" "
"align=\"center\"> <img src=\"/img/design/gameplay/battle2.png\" "
"alt=\"弓手示意2\" width=\"400px\" align=\"center\">"
msgstr ""
"1. Archer   &emsp;&emsp;The archer shoots 3 arrows at once. Has some AOE "
"capability.   &emsp;&emsp;When operating, the player can choose different"
" arrow trajectories, resulting in either straight-line arrows or high "
"parabolic arcs. This enables effects like hitting the back line or "
"dealing AOE damage.   &emsp;&emsp;The archer can only move left/right and"
" attack. <img src=\"/img/design/gameplay/battle1.png\" alt=\"Archer "
"Illustration 1\" width=\"400px\" align=\"center\"> <img "
"src=\"/img/design/gameplay/battle2.png\" alt=\"Archer Illustration 2\" "
"width=\"400px\" align=\"center\">"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:30
msgid "弓手示意1"
msgstr "Archer Illustration 1"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:30
msgid "弓手示意2"
msgstr "Archer Illustration 2"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:36
msgid ""
"2.盾⼭   &emsp;&emsp;盾⼭的作⽤是作为前排，进⾏防御。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;默认情况下，就⼀直举着盾牌进⾏防御。远程弹道技能，碰到盾牌会停⽌前进，并减少50%的伤害（因为远程弹道技能只能打1个⼈，这样就算打到盾⼭了，⾃然就停⽌了。好像不⽤加什么设定。）。近战技能的伤害范围，如果和盾牌的范围有重合，则减少50%伤害。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;还给盾⼭增加了⼀个技能，盾击，会把敌⼈击退。盾击时就没有防御了。能达成⼀种军队推进的效果。（加这个技能，主要是觉得⼀直举着盾防御，太⽆聊了）"
"   盾⼭能做3件事，左右移动，举盾防御、盾击。 <img src=\"/img/design/gameplay/battle3.png\" "
"alt=\"盾⼭示意1\" width=\"130px\" align=\"center\"> <img "
"src=\"/img/design/gameplay/battle4.png\" alt=\"盾⼭示意2\" width=\"200px\" "
"align=\"center\">"
msgstr ""
"2. Shield Mountain   &emsp;&emsp;The Shield Mountain serves as the front "
"line for defense.   &emsp;&emsp;By default, it continuously holds up its "
"shield for defense. Ranged projectile skills stop when they hit the "
"shield and deal 50% reduced damage (since ranged projectile skills only "
"hit 1 unit, hitting the Shield Mountain naturally stops them — no "
"additional rules seem needed). If a melee skill's damage range overlaps "
"with the shield's range, damage is reduced by 50%.   &emsp;&emsp;The "
"Shield Mountain also has an added skill — Shield Bash, which knocks back "
"enemies. There's no defense while bashing. This can create an army push "
"effect. (This skill was added mainly because just holding up a shield for"
" defense is too boring.)   The Shield Mountain can do 3 things: move "
"left/right, shield defense, and shield bash. <img "
"src=\"/img/design/gameplay/battle3.png\" alt=\"Shield Mountain "
"Illustration 1\" width=\"130px\" align=\"center\"> <img "
"src=\"/img/design/gameplay/battle4.png\" alt=\"Shield Mountain "
"Illustration 2\" width=\"200px\" align=\"center\">"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:36
msgid "盾⼭示意1"
msgstr "Shield Mountain Illustration 1"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:36
msgid "盾⼭示意2"
msgstr "Shield Mountain Illustration 2"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:43
msgid ""
"3.狂战⼠   &emsp;&emsp;狂战⼠的作⽤是破坏阵型。   &emsp;&emsp;狂战⼠有⼀个跳跃技能，因此能越过前排，打到后排。 "
"狂战⼠能做3件事，左右移动，跳跃、攻击。 <img src=\"/img/design/gameplay/battle5.png\" "
"alt=\"狂战⼠示意\" width=\"350px\" align=\"center\">"
msgstr ""
"3. Berserker   &emsp;&emsp;The Berserker's role is to break enemy "
"formations.   &emsp;&emsp;The Berserker has a jump skill, allowing it to "
"leap over the front line and hit the back line. The Berserker can do 3 "
"things: move left/right, jump, and attack. <img "
"src=\"/img/design/gameplay/battle5.png\" alt=\"Berserker Illustration\" "
"width=\"350px\" align=\"center\">"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:43
msgid "狂战⼠示意"
msgstr "Berserker Illustration"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:48
msgid ""
"敌⼈   &emsp;&emsp;敌⼈还没都设计好。感觉现在的战⽃模式需要⼀些⼩怪，所以先设计了2种⼩怪。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;第⼀种是垃圾⼸⼿，只能射出1只箭，并且⼀定是向前的。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;第⼆种是垃圾战⼠，会⼀直向前跑，直到碰到敌⼈，然后就释放攻击技能。 <img "
"src=\"/img/design/gameplay/battle6.png\" alt=\"敌⼈示意1\" width=\"200px\" "
"align=\"center\">"
msgstr ""
"Enemies   &emsp;&emsp;Enemies haven't been fully designed yet. The "
"current battle mode seems to need some small enemies, so 2 types were "
"designed first.   &emsp;&emsp;The first is the Trash Archer, which can "
"only shoot 1 arrow, always forward.   &emsp;&emsp;The second is the Trash"
" Warrior, which keeps running forward until it contacts an enemy, then "
"unleashes an attack skill. <img src=\"/img/design/gameplay/battle6.png\" "
"alt=\"Enemy Illustration 1\" width=\"200px\" align=\"center\">"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:48
msgid "敌⼈示意1"
msgstr "Enemy Illustration 1"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:54
msgid ""
"战场调度   &emsp;&emsp;战场调度，第⼀个是上场，选择位置。这个是方案5中已经设计的。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;具体的，应该还有什么时候上场等问题。我也没想好。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;第⼆个是，为每个⻆⾊选择他关注的“⼀个敌⼈”或“⼀块区域”。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;这是方案5中“⽬标优先级”的具体化。并且能和训练结合起来。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;训练与实际战⽃不同。训练时，采⽤的是局部的战⽃场景。⽐如，训练时，打3个⼩怪，实际战⽃时，先打3个⼩怪，过会⼉⼜来3个。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;通过为⻆⾊选择他关注的“⼀个敌⼈”或“⼀块区域”，能把训练和实际战⽃的差异连接起来。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;现在为了简化，所以就先只关注“⼀个敌⼈”。但是只关注⼀个敌⼈，好像有些单位的训练没法做，所以就加⼊“⼀块区域”。这种区分，好像对训练的⽅式也能有启迪。"
" （实际战⽃是，可以设置⻆⾊关注“离我最近的那个敌⼈”）"
msgstr ""
"Battlefield Dispatch   &emsp;&emsp;Battlefield dispatch: the first is "
"deployment, choosing a position. This was already designed in Plan 5.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Specifically, there should also be questions about when to "
"deploy. I haven't figured this out yet.   &emsp;&emsp;The second is "
"selecting a focus target for each character — \"one enemy\" or \"one "
"area.\"   &emsp;&emsp;This is a concretization of \"Target Priority\" "
"from Plan 5. And it can be combined with training.   &emsp;&emsp;Training"
" differs from actual combat. Training uses localized battle scenarios. "
"For example, during training you fight 3 small enemies, while in actual "
"combat you fight 3 first, then another 3 come later.   &emsp;&emsp;By "
"selecting each character's focus on \"one enemy\" or \"one area,\" the "
"gap between training and actual combat can be bridged.   &emsp;&emsp;For "
"simplification now, we'll start with just focusing on \"one enemy.\" But "
"only focusing on one enemy seems to make training some units impossible, "
"so \"one area\" is also included. This distinction might also inspire "
"training methods. (In actual combat, you can set characters to focus on "
"\"the nearest enemy.\")"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/battle-experience5-detail.md:63
msgid ""
"补充   "
"&emsp;&emsp;这个⽅案还有很多没有具体到；⽽且，相⽐方案5，没太明显地起到减少⼯作的作⽤，反⽽增加了不少⼯作；有些设计可能有些飘、没着落。"
"   这些都可以再想办法啦。主要还是拿出来讨论⼀下。   相⽐方案5，应该还是具体了⼀些，就算没跑偏。"
msgstr ""
"Supplement   &emsp;&emsp;This plan still has many aspects that aren't "
"concrete yet; moreover, compared to Plan 5, it doesn't obviously reduce "
"work — in fact it adds quite a bit of work; some designs might be a bit "
"airy and ungrounded.   These can all be figured out later. The main "
"purpose is to put this out for discussion.   Compared to Plan 5, it "
"should be more concrete, even if not entirely on the right track."

